- `-p`/`--parents` with explicit mode applying only to the final newly-created directory; intermediates keep umask rule + owner 0o300 ensured
- Invalid mode rejected before any filesystem mutation, with `mkdir: invalid mode 'STR'` and exit 1
- All prior behavior preserved: `--`, bare `-`, unknown option errors, multi-operand continuation, byte-safe paths, no stdin, empty stdout on success

